Uncut Gems is a drama, thriller, crime film directed by Benny Safdie.

3
00:18:32,727 --> 00:18:38,727
A charismatic New York City jeweler always on the lookout for the next big score makes a
series of high-stakes bets that could lead to the windfall of a lifetime.

4
